tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-251-an-escape-by-code-writes-only-what-a-line-cannot-show.hero:18:22: error[escape_not_needed]: `\u{7d}` writes a brace, which the text of an `f` literal writes `}}`, its one spelling: write that
